age.engineering/guides/op-xy/sequencer#extend-with-bar",{"id":46,"text":47,"source":48,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":49},"default-50","In a new project that setting reads 50, about half a step, according to decoded project files.","docs/research/10-xy-format.md#34-patternstruct-base-clones-walking","community-verified",[51],{"id":29,"goal":52,"preconditions":53,"steps":54,"result":26,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"Make a note last several steps",[],[55],{"keys":56,"note":57,"set":26},"step n + step m","press the step where the note should end; press it again to switch the ending",[],[60,61,62],"sequencer.bar-menu","sequencer.component-pulse-hold","instrument.play-mode","The bar menu's length suits drums and plucked lines; anything that has to sustain is better stretched\nnote by note. Pulse hold is related but also pauses the track.",[65,67,69,70],{"url":31,"kind":66},"guide",{"url":39,"kind":68},"changelog",{"url":44,"kind":66},{"url":48,"kind":71},"research",[73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88],"step.1","step.2","step.3","step.4","step.5","step.6","step.7","step.8","step.9","step.10","step.11","step.12","step.13","step.14","step.15","step.16",{"id":11,"title":90},"Sequencer",{"id":92,"title":93},"sequencer.live-recording","Live recording",{"id":95,"title":96},"sequencer.nudge","Nudging steps off the grid",{"basics.key-notation":98,"basics.main-modes":99,"basics.modules":100,"basics.track-buttons":101,"basics.linked-tracks":102,"basics.patterns-scenes-songs":103,"basics.workflow":104,"basics.firmware-versions":105,"hardware.layout":106,"hardware.power-and-charging":107,"hardware.connectors":108,"hardware.specifications":109,"hardware.te-boot":110,"hardware.firmware-update":111,"hardware.factory-reset":112,"hardware.system-menu":113,"hardware.safety-and-care":114,"hardware.in-the-box":115,"sequencer.overview":116,"sequencer.step-entry":117,"sequencer.step-recording":118,"sequencer.live-recording":93,"s